  "title": "Qt: Ensure that filter status bar error updates in bad state",
  "description": "\"All happy [filters] are alike; each unhappy [filter] is unhappy in\nits own way.\" If the FilterEdit state has stayed invalid, it doesn't\nneed a visual update, but it still needs to notify other listeners\nabout its bad state. Even if the state remained SyntaxState::Invalid,\nthe exact error message might change.\n\nFixes #21321\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
